CiukiOS Wine 10.0: msvcrt-sbcs-code-page
Pinned base: b073859675060c9211fcbccfd90e4e87520dc2c2
Modified by CiukiOS, 2026-10-20. LGPL-2.1-or-later.
The C locale and _setmbcp(_MB_CP_SBCS) use code page 0, as the Microsoft
CRT documents for a single-byte code page (_getmbcp returns 0), instead of
US-ASCII 20127, which the CiukiOS KERNEL32 does not provide (437, 850 and
1252): GetCPInfo(20127) failed and msvcrt.dll refused DLL_PROCESS_ATTACH.

--- a/dlls/msvcrt/mbcs.c
+++ b/dlls/msvcrt/mbcs.c
@@ -254,7 +254,10 @@ threadmbcinfo* create_mbcinfo(int cp, LCID lcid, threadmbcinfo *old_mbcinfo)
           break;
       /* fall through (C locale) */
     case _MB_CP_SBCS:
-      newcp = 20127;   /* ASCII */
+      /* CiukiOS: KERNEL32 has the code pages 437, 850 and 1252, not 20127.
+       * The Microsoft CRT documents 0 as the code page of the single-byte
+       * case (_getmbcp) and builds its tables from the ANSI code page. */
+      newcp = 0;
       break;
     default:
       newcp = cp;
